</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Your Spirit with my spirit is the key—</l><l>A mutual dwelling place for You and me!</l><l>By this organic union that we share</l><l>We have become by grace one loving pair.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>By faith I have been joined to You, dear Lord,</l><l>Now our two spirits are in one accord!</l><l>Thus joined and mingled, I abide in You,</l><l>In thought, intention, and in all I do.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>“Abide in Me and I’ll abide in you,”</l><l>Both a commandment and a promise true!</l><l>We may much fruit unto the Father bear</l><l>As we abide in Him whose life we share.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
